B.EO=s(["Hadi: The dice belong to Allah \u2014 the moves belong to you.","Hadi: A token sent home is not an ending; the board always invites return.","Hadi: Patience \u2014 the six will come, as rizq comes: on time.","Hadi: I protect my stars. Do you protect yours?","Hadi: One careful step beats three hurried ones."],t.s)
