B.aYp=new A.bz("Sunan an-Nasa\u2019i","Al-Nasa\u2019i (d. 915 CE)","Highly respected for the strict criteria the author used in selecting narrators.")
B.aZc=new A.bz("Sunan Ibn Majah","Ibn Majah (d. 887 CE)","Added as the sixth book by the scholar Ibn al-Qaisarani in the 11th century \u2014 completing the six canonical collections (al-Kutub as-Sittah).")
