B.bF9=new A.br("Yusuf \u2014 From Well to Throne","Betrayed by brothers, sold, imprisoned \u2014 and he forgave them by name. Patience that keeps its softness.","Has anyone wronged you that you could forgive by name?","prophet-yusuf")
B.WL=new A.br("Ayyub \u2014 The Patient One","Everything taken, years of illness, one dua at the end \u2014 and the mountain moved. Long patience, short words.","What would you say to Allah if you could only say one sentence?","prophet-ayyub")
B.bFy=new A.br("Ya\u2019qub \u2014 The Beautiful Patience","He lost a son, then another \u2014 and said 'I only complain of my suffering and my grief to Allah' (12:86). Grief and patience can share a chest.","What does 'beautiful patience' look like in our house this week?","prophet-yaqub")
B.WM=new A.br("Nuh \u2014 The Long Building","He built the ship for decades before a drop of rain, and called his people for 950 years. Persistence is a form of worship.","What are you building that no one can see yet?","prophet-nuh")
B.bG8=new A.br("The Man Who Killed 99","The road to paradise is measured in miles \u2014 and he walked them. Repentance has a geography: move toward the righteous.","What is one step you could take toward a better place this month?","tale-99")
B.atW=s([B.bF9,B.WL,B.bFy,B.WM,B.bG8],t.jm)
B.bF7=new A.n5("Patience & Trust","The Prophets were not supermen \u2014 they were the most patient men. These chapters teach waiting without despairing.",B.atW)
B.bGb=new A.br("Ibrahim \u2014 The Two Rivers of Reason","He argued a star, a moon, a sun into the ground, then walked into a fire that became cool. Conviction that reasons and then leaps.",u.nl,"prophet-ibrahim")
B.bFb=new A.br("Musa \u2014 Before Pharaoh","A stuttering shepherd demanded freedom from the world\u2019s tyrant \u2014 with a staff and a brother. Courage is a stutter that keeps speaking.","What is your 'staff' \u2014 the small thing you carry that could face something big?","prophet-musa")
B.bG0=new A.br("Maryam \u2014 The Palm Tree","Alone, laboring, accused \u2014 and the infant spoke from the cradle. Solitude with Allah is never abandonment.","When have you felt alone but not abandoned?","woman-maryam")
B.WN=new A.br("Bilal \u2014 One Word","The mountain of sand could not crush one word: Ahad. The word outlived the empire that buried him under it.","What is your one word \u2014 the thing you would not stop saying?","comp-bilal")
B.bFn=new A.br("Sumayyah \u2014 The First to Give Everything","The first martyr of Islam: a slave woman who refused to curse the Prophet. She taught the ummah its first lesson in standing.","What does 'standing for something' cost, and what does it buy?","woman-sumayyah")
B.aBg=s([B.bGb,B.bFb,B.bG0,B.WN,B.bFn],t.jm)
B.bF3=new A.n5("Courage & Conviction","Standing alone against everyone \u2014 and standing anyway.",B.aBg)
B.WK=new A.br("Adam \u2014 The First Repentance","One honest sentence opened the door of mercy for every sinner after him. Repentance is the oldest human skill.","What does a real apology look like \u2014 from you to someone else, or to Allah?","prophet-adam")
B.bGd=new A.br("The Prostitute\u2019s Thirst","One bowl of water for a thirsty dog \u2014 and her ledger was closed by mercy. No one is beyond a door Allah opens.","What small kindness might count more than you think?","tale-dog")
B.bFe=new A.br("Yunus \u2014 The Whale\u2019s Belly","He ran from the call and landed in the darkest place \u2014 and one sentence reached the Throne from inside a fish. No place is too dark for la ilaha illa anta.","What is your 'whale\u2019s belly' \u2014 the dark place you could pray from right now?","prophet-yunus")
B.bFc=new A.br(u.f4,"She said the dua of the afflicted \u2014 'to You we return' \u2014 and her heartache became revelation. Grief itself can be worship.","What dua could turn your hardest day into an address to Allah?","woman-umm-salama")
B.bFs=new A.br("The Man Who Asked for Water","Barsisa\u2019s story warns \u2014 but within it lies the door: repentance has no statute of limitations while the heart beats.","What does this story warn you about \u2014 and what does it promise you?","tale-barsisa")
B.ati=s([B.WK,B.bGd,B.bFe,B.bFc,B.bFs],t.jm)
B.bF6=new A.n5("Mercy & Forgiveness","The strongest ones lowered the wing \u2014 and the door of repentance never closed.",B.ati)
B.bFp=new A.br("Sulayman \u2014 The Kingdom","A kingdom no one will have after him \u2014 and his dua was only 'make me grateful.' Might chose gratitude.","What do you have that you never asked for?","prophet-sulayman")
B.bFF=new A.br("The Two Gardens","The man who counted his harvest forgot his Lord \u2014 one night of frost took it all. 'Wealth and children are [but] adornment of the worldly life. But the enduring good deeds are better to your Lord for reward' (18:46).","What is your 'garden' \u2014 and what would remain if it vanished tonight?","tale-two-gardens")
B.bFE=new A.br("Hagar \u2014 She Ran Seven Times","Alone in a desert with a crying child \u2014 and 'He will not waste us' became the walk between two hills that every pilgrim still walks.","Where are you 'running between the hills' right now?","woman-hagar")
B.bFu=new A.br("Asiya \u2014 A House Built Wrong","She lived in Pharaoh\u2019s palace and was heartbroken in it \u2014 and Allah showed her her house in Paradise. Sometimes the palace is the test.",u.a,"woman-asiya")
B.bFM=new A.br("The Sleepers of the Cave","They slept through an empire and woke to find their small faith had outlasted the world that hunted them. Hold what you have; time is on your side.","What small thing are you holding that history may one day vindicate?","tale-cave-people")
B.aHK=s([B.bFp,B.bFF,B.bFE,B.bFu,B.bFM],t.jm)
B.bF5=new A.n5("Gratitude & Contentment","The ones who counted their blessings instead of their lacks \u2014 and found the scale already tipped.",B.aHK)
B.bFJ=new A.br("Abu Bakr \u2014 The Steady One","The first caliph who held the ummah together with two years of steady, unglamorous work. When others panicked, he was already planning.","Who holds your family together with steady, unglamorous work? Thank them.","comp-abu-bakr")
B.bG2=new A.br("Umar \u2014 Justice on Horseback","The second caliph patrolled Medina at night and answered to no one but Allah. The milk-seller\u2019s story is his most told parable of fairness.","Who in your life models justice that no one can buy?","comp-umar")
B.bGs=new A.br("Uthman \u2014 The Gatherer","The third caliph ordered the one mushaf and the ummah has read from it ever since. Gentleness and decisiveness in the same hands.","What could you gather or preserve that would outlive you?","comp-uthman")
B.bFZ=new A.br("Ali \u2014 Raised in the Prophet\u2019s House","The fourth caliph, raised in the Prophet\u2019s house. The era\u2019s scholarship begins with him.","What knowledge could you pass on \u2014 who could you teach this month?","comp-ali")
B.bGf=new A.br("Salman \u2014 The Seeker","A Persian who left one religion after another searching for truth \u2014 and found it in the Prophet\u2019s description of a man between two marks. Seeking is a virtue when it is honest.","Are you still seeking \u2014 and is your seeking honest?","comp-salman")
B.bGy=new A.br("Abu Hurayrah \u2014 The Memorizer","He came to Islam late and memorized more hadith than any companion \u2014 by hunger and repetition. The one who writes down what he hears outlasts the one who only listens.","What have you heard this month that you should write down before it is lost?","comp-abu-hurayrah")
B.bGe=new A.br("Khabbab \u2014 The Patient One","He was tortured on burning coals and asked the Prophet: will you not ask Allah to help us? The Prophet\u2019s answer taught patience that counts in years, not days.","What are you asking for that might arrive in years, not days?","comp-khabbab")
B.bFL=new A.br("Ibn Masud \u2014 The Reciter","A shepherd boy who followed the Prophet and became one of the greatest reciters. The first to recite Qur\u2019an aloud in Makkah \u2014 and the Quraysh beat him for it.","What are you willing to be beaten for?","comp-ibn-masud")
B.bGo=new A.br("Musab \u2014 The Handsome Ambassador","Sent to Madinah alone to teach a city \u2014 he taught with the mushaf in one hand and adab in the other. Died at Uhud holding the flag.","Where are you an ambassador \u2014 and are you teaching adab or just facts?","comp-musab")
B.bG7=new A.br("Ammar \u2014 The Builder","He built the masjid in the heat of the sun while others rested, and the Prophet\u2019s dua made the heat easy. Work done for Allah is never wasted.","What are you building that no one will credit you for?","comp-ammar")
B.bFP=new A.br("Suhayb \u2014 The Arsonist\u2019s Price","He bought his freedom from Quraysh with every dirham he owned. The Prophet\u2019s comment: 'Suhayb has profited.' Sometimes the price of freedom is everything you have \u2014 and it is still cheap.","What price would you pay for your freedom \u2014 and is it worth more than what you hold?","comp-suhayb")
B.bFl=new A.br("Khalid ibn al-Walid \u2014 The Drawn Sword","The general who never lost a battle, who drew his sword at Mu\u2019tah and wrote the letter of honor to the defeated. Strength that answers to a higher command.","Where is your strength \u2014 and does it answer to a higher command?","comp-thawr")
B.bGr=new A.br("Abu Ubaydah \u2014 The Trustworthy","The commander the Prophet \ufdfa trusted with the army \u2014 so trustworthy that the Prophet \ufdfa said every ummah has a trustee, and Abu Ubaydah is the trustee of this ummah.","Who trusts you with what matters most \u2014 and are you worthy of the trust?","comp-ubayy")
B.bGq=new A.br("Sa\u2019d ibn Abi Waqqas \u2014 The Archer of Uhud","The first to shoot an arrow in the path of Allah; the Prophet \ufdfa gave him his own arrows and said: shoot, may my father and mother be your ransom.","What is your arrow \u2014 the skill you can aim for Allah\u2019s cause?","comp-saad")
B.bFY=new A.br("Talhah \u2014 The Shield of Uhud","He shielded the Prophet \ufdfa with his own body at Uhud, taking the arrows meant for him. The one who shields another carries the reward of both.","Who are you shielding \u2014 and what is it costing you?","comp-talha-zubayr")
B.bFU=new A.br("Az-Zubayr \u2014 The Disciplined","The Prophet \ufdfa said every prophet has a hawari and Az-Zubayr is mine \u2014 the disciple who carried the standard and the discipline.","Whose disciple are you \u2014 and what are you learning from them?","comp-hudhayfah")
B.bGa=new A.br("Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf \u2014 The Wealthy Ascetic","One of the ten promised Paradise, and one of the wealthiest \u2014 he gave so much in one day that the caravan could not carry it. Wealth that flowed, not pooled.","Does your wealth flow or pool \u2014 and what would change the direction?","comp-abdurrahman")
B.bG6=new A.br("Sa\u2019id ibn Zayd \u2014 The Hidden One","One of the ten promised Paradise, and one of the least known \u2014 the hidden ones are not forgotten. The ten included the famous and the nearly anonymous.","Are you content to be the hidden one \u2014 the reward is the same?","comp-said-zayd")
B.bG9=new A.br("Zayd ibn Harithah \u2014 The Freed Slave General","Taken as a slave, freed, adopted, then given command of armies while the greatest men served under him. Rank is given by taqwa, not lineage.","What rank have you been given that you did not earn \u2014 and are you using it well?","comp-said-zayd")
B.bFQ=new A.br("Uthman ibn Maz\u2019un \u2014 The Ascetic","The first muhajir to die in Madinah; he gave up everything and the Prophet \ufdfa wept at his grave. The one who left the dunya before the dunya left him.","What could you leave of the dunya today without regret?","comp-hudhayfah")
B.bFO=new A.br("Abdullah ibn Umar \u2014 The Strict Follower","He followed every sunna so literally that people thought he was extreme \u2014 until they realized he was simply unwilling to add or subtract from the Prophet\u2019s way.","Is there a sunna you know but do not follow \u2014 and what is stopping you?","comp-ibn-umar")
B.bFB=new A.br("Anas ibn Malik \u2014 The Servant","He served the Prophet \ufdfa for ten years, from age ten to twenty \u2014 and the Prophet \ufdfa never once said uff to him. Ten years, zero harsh words.","Who serves you \u2014 and have you said uff to them this month?","comp-anas")
B.bGp=new A.br("Jabir ibn Abdullah \u2014 The Young Witness","Eighteen at Uhud, burying his father and brother with his own hands \u2014 and still fighting. The young are not exempt from standing.","What battle is your generation facing \u2014 and are you standing?","comp-hamza")
B.bFI=new A.br("Abu Dharr \u2014 The Uncompromising","He spoke truth to power until Umar sent him away \u2014 and he lived the rest of his days in humility. The one who would not bend the truth for any throne.","What truth have you bent to avoid discomfort \u2014 and could you unbend it?","comp-abu-dharr")
B.bFv=new A.br("Muadh ibn Jabal \u2014 The Scholar","The Prophet \ufdfa said the most knowledgeable of my ummah in halal and haram is Muadh \u2014 and sent him to Yemen to teach. Knowledge that travels.","What knowledge do you have that needs to travel \u2014 and who is waiting to receive it?","comp-muadh")
B.avp=s([B.bFJ,B.bG2,B.bGs,B.bFZ,B.WN,B.bGf,B.bGy,B.bGe,B.bFL,B.bGo,B.bG7,B.bFP,B.bFl,B.bGr,B.bGq,B.bFY,B.bFU,B.bGa,B.bG6,B.bG9,B.bFQ,B.bFO,B.bFB,B.bGp,B.bFI,B.bFv],t.jm)
B.bF0=new A.n5("The Companions \u2014 The Living Curriculum","The men who carried the message into the world. Each one teaches a trait by having lived it.",B.avp)
B.bFV=new A.br("Jibril \u2014 The Trustworthy Spirit","The angel who brought revelation to every prophet, who taught the Quran to Muhammad \ufdfa, who comforted Maryam. The most honored creature is a messenger \u2014 service is rank.","What message has been entrusted to you to deliver \u2014 and to whom?","ghayb-jibril")
B.bFg=new A.br("The Scribes \u2014 Who Write","Honorable scribes record every word \u2014 sitting on the right and the left. You are being written; write well.","If your words today were published, would you sign them?","ghayb-scribes")
B.bFD=new A.br("Munkar and Nakir \u2014 The Questioners","Two angels question every soul in the grave. The preparation for their questions is the preparation for every exam: know your Lord, your religion, your prophet.","What three answers would you give them today \u2014 are they ready?","ghayb-munkar-nakir")
B.bG4=new A.br("The Whisperer \u2014 Who Slips Away","Shaytan whispers and then withdraws, leaving you to carry the doubt. Recognize the whisper as foreign \u2014 it is not your voice.","When doubt whispers, how do you answer it \u2014 and does your answer help?","ghayb-whisper")
B.bFk=new A.br("The Qarin \u2014 The Constant Companion","Every human has a companion from the jinn assigned to them. The Prophet \ufdfa showed that this companionship can be turned to good \u2014 the qarin of a believer becomes a helper.","Is your constant companion helping you toward good \u2014 or are you helping it toward harm?","ghayb-companion-qarin")
B.awA=s([B.bFV,B.bFg,B.bFD,B.bG4,B.bFk],t.jm)
B.bF4=new A.n5("The Unseen World","The angels who write, the jinn who whisper, and the realities behind the veil \u2014 the ghayb that faith embraces.",B.awA)
B.bFA=new A.br("The Twelve Signs","The Prophet \ufdfa described the major signs in order \u2014 the smoke, the beast, the rising of the sun from the west. They arrive like dominoes; the believer reads them as reminders, not as terror.","Which sign feels closest in your lifetime \u2014 and does it change how you live today?","sign-01")
B.bG_=new A.br("Knowledge Lost, Ignorance Widespread","The Prophet \ufdfa foretold that knowledge would be taken away and ignorance would prevail \u2014 not because books vanished, but because the hearts that carried them did.","What knowledge are you responsible to keep alive in your family \u2014 and who are you teaching it to?","sign-02")
B.bFi=new A.br("The Hour Is Closer","The Prophet \ufdfa was asked about the Hour and said: what have you prepared for it? The question turns every timeline into a to-do list.","What have you prepared? Name one thing \u2014 and one more you could add this month.","sign-12")
B.awz=s([B.bFA,B.bG_,B.bFi],t.jm)
B.bF2=new A.n5("The Last Days","The signs that precede the final hour \u2014 not to frighten, but to wake the sleeping heart.",B.awz)
B.bGv=new A.br("The Seven Under the Shade","Seven whom Allah will shade \u2014 the youth in worship, the one who weeps alone, the one who gives in secret. Your youth is capital; spend it on the shade.","Which of the seven is within your reach this year?","mh-youth-seven")
B.bFt=new A.br("The Birds Leave Hungry","Tawakkul is the bird\u2019s departure \u2014 the wings move, but the rizq is not the bird\u2019s to manage. Plan, then release.","What are you chasing in fear that you could chase with tawakkul instead?","mh-money-birds")
B.bFR=new A.br("The Refuge of the Debtor","The debtor\u2019s supplication is answered until the debt is paid \u2014 but the debt must still be paid. Face the number, make the plan.","Do you know your total debt? Write it down \u2014 the first step of every exit.","mh-money-debt")
B.bFo=new A.br("The Upper Hand","The upper hand gives; the lower hand receives. The Prophet \ufdfa said the upper hand is better \u2014 and the one who gives while he fears poverty has outwitted Shaytan.","Which hand are you \u2014 and could you move it one notch upward this month?","mh-money-hand")
B.bGl=new A.br("The Weeping Eye","The eye that weeps from the fear of Allah, and the eye that stays awake guarding the borders \u2014 both are written as worship. Tears are not weakness.","When did you last weep \u2014 for Allah, or for His creation? Is that too long?","mh-soul-tears")
B.bFz=new A.br("Solitude Is a Room","You were not created for the crowd. The Prophet \ufdfa sought the cave before the mission; the quiet hour is where the heart is furnished.","Where is your cave \u2014 and when did you last sit in it?","mh-soul-solitude")
B.bGk=new A.br("Speak Good or Stay Silent \u2014 Including Online","The tongue\u2019s law applies to the keyboard. The comment section is the same fire; the anonymous handle is the same tongue.","Run your last five posts through the filter: would you say them with the person standing there?","mh-society-tongue")
B.bFH=new A.br("The Door That Never Closes","The slave who ran from his master and returned \u2014 forgiven. The one who killed ninety-nine \u2014 forgiven. The door of repentance does not close until the sun rises from the west or the soul reaches the throat.","Is there a door you think is closed for you \u2014 and are you sure?","mh-reflection-023")
B.bGx=new A.br("The Returning Heart","The heart is between two fingers of the Most Merciful \u2014 He turns it as He wills. Your inconsistency is not the end; it is the material of return.","When you drift, what calls you back \u2014 and who or what is that Caller?","mh-reflection-24")
B.bFw=new A.br("Visit the Graves","The Prophet \ufdfa said: I had forbidden you to visit the graves, but now visit them \u2014 they remind you of the Hereafter. The reminder that ends every distraction.","When did you last stand at a grave \u2014 and what did it tell you?","mh-death-graves")
B.bGA=new A.br("The Work of Your Own Hand","The Prophet \ufdfa worked with his hands; no one ever fed him without his working. Dignity is in the labor, not the title.","What work do you do with your own hands \u2014 and do you honor it?","mh-work-hand")
B.bFC=new A.br("The Eye Weeps and the Heart Grieves","The Prophet \ufdfa wept at his son\u2019s death and said: we say only what pleases our Lord. Permission to grieve, inside the permission to praise.","Are you carrying a grief you have not named \u2014 and could you name it to Allah tonight?","mh-grief-ibrahim")
B.aMH=s([B.bGv,B.bFt,B.bFR,B.bFo,B.bGl,B.bFz,B.bGk,B.bFH,B.bGx,B.bFw,B.bGA,B.bFC],t.jm)
B.bF8=new A.n5("The Modern Life","The hadith applied to the daily battles \u2014 the phone, the debt, the burnout, the feed.",B.aMH)
B.bFT=new A.br("Idris \u2014 The Scribe","He was raised to a high station (19:57) \u2014 the first to write by the pen, the first to study the stars for worship. Knowledge was worship before it was a profession.","What are you learning that could become worship?","prophet-idris")
B.bFr=new A.br("Hud and Salih \u2014 The Clear Signs","Two messengers to two mighty peoples (\u2019Ad and Thamud) \u2014 each brought a sign, each was rejected, each was vindicated. The sign is not the problem; the heart is.","What sign have you been shown that you have not yet followed?","prophet-hud")
B.bGn=new A.br("Lut \u2014 The Unheeded Warning","He warned his people until the angels came \u2014 and even then he was told to leave by night. Some doors close while the caller is still calling.","When is it time to stop calling someone and start protecting your own household?","prophet-lut")
B.bG5=new A.br("Ibrahim, Ishaq, and Ya\u2019qub \u2014 The Household of Faith","One household carried the message for three generations: the father who reasoned to tawhid, the son who submitted, the grandson who named it Israel. Faith is inherited when it is lived.","What are you passing down \u2014 by your actions, not your words?","prophet-ibrahim")
B.bGi=new A.br("Ismail \u2014 The Willing Son","The son who said: O my father, do as you are commanded \u2014 you will find me, if Allah wills, of the patient (37:102). The ram replaced the boy, and the ummah still commemorates the surrender at every Eid.","What are you willing to surrender that you love \u2014 trusting the replacement will come?","prophet-ismail")
B.bGB=new A.br("Shu\u2019ayb \u2014 The Honest Measure","He preached to the merchants: give full measure, weigh with the straight scale, do not diminish the people\u2019s goods (11:85). The first economic reformer was a prophet.","Is your measure full \u2014 at work, at home, in your promises?","prophet-shuayb")
B.bFG=new A.br("Musa and Harun \u2014 The Stutterer and His Brother","Musa asked for Harun because he feared his stutter would fail the message; Allah answered the ask and sent both. Weakness acknowledged is strength assisted.","Who is your Harun \u2014 the one you can ask to stand beside you when your own voice shakes?","prophet-musa")
B.bGm=new A.br("Dawud and Sulayman \u2014 The Kingdoms","Dawud ruled and recited; Sulayman asked for a kingdom no one would have after him and then asked only to be grateful. Power chose gratitude.","What would you ask for if you could ask for anything \u2014 and is gratitude in your asking?","prophet-sulayman")
B.bGj=new A.br("Dhul-Kifl \u2014 The Oath Kept","He swore to judge between his people with justice, day and night. The oath kept is the character written.","What oath or promise have you made that you are still keeping?","prophet-dhul-kifl")
B.bG3=new A.br("Yunus \u2014 The Whale\u2019s Belly","He ran from the call and landed in the darkest place \u2014 and one sentence reached the Throne. No place is too dark for la ilaha illa anta.","What is your whale\u2019s belly \u2014 and what would you pray from inside it?","prophet-yunus")
B.bGt=new A.br("Zakariya \u2014 The Private Call","He asked for a child in a whisper only Allah heard, and the answer came while he was old. Private prayers are not small prayers.","What do you pray for that no one else knows \u2014 and are you still praying it?","prophet-zakariya")
B.bFq=new A.br("Isa \u2014 The Word from Him","Born of a virgin, speaking from the cradle, healing by Allah\u2019s leave \u2014 and he said: I am the slave of Allah. The miracles served the message, never the man.","What gifts or abilities do you have \u2014 and do they serve the message or the ego?","prophet-isa")
B.bGz=new A.br("Ilyas and Al-Yasa \u2014 The Reminders","Ilyas reminded his people to worship Allah alone (37:123-126); Al-Yasa succeeded him. The reminder is a relay, not a solo.","Who reminded you of Allah when you had forgotten \u2014 and have you thanked them?","prophet-ilyas")
B.bFK=new A.br("Ibrahim\u2019s Sons \u2014 The Splitting of the Way","From Ishaq came Ya\u2019qub; from Ismail came Muhammad. One father, two branches, one final message. The family tree of faith is wide.","What branch of your own family tree could carry a message forward?","prophet-ishaq")
B.bGg=new A.br("Ibrahim \u2014 The Two Rivers of Reason","He reasoned his way to tawhid before revelation came \u2014 and was thrown into the fire that became cool. Conviction that reasons and then leaps.",u.nl,"prophet-ibrahim")
B.auF=s([B.WK,B.bFT,B.WM,B.bFr,B.bGn,B.bG5,B.bGi,B.bGB,B.bFG,B.bGm,B.WL,B.bGj,B.bG3,B.bGt,B.bFq,B.bGz,B.bFK,B.bGg],t.jm)
B.bF_=new A.n5("The Prophets \u2014 The Long Chain","Every prophet carried the same message to a different people. Together they are the longest curriculum in history.",B.auF)
B.bG1=new A.br("Taif \u2014 Praying for Your Enemies\u2019 Grandchildren","Stoned and bleeding, and he prayed for the grandchildren of the people who stoned him. The highest form of hope is a dua for your enemy\u2019s children.","Who has wronged you \u2014 and what would praying for their children look like?","kh-taif")
B.bFa=new A.br("The Weight of One Atom","Whoever does an atom\u2019s weight of good will see it (99:7). The smallest deed is on a scale that never rounds down.","What atom-deed did you do today that no one saw?","kh-atom")
B.bFS=new A.br("The Beautiful Patience","Ya\u2019qub said: I only complain of my suffering to Allah (12:86). Grief and patience can share the same chest \u2014 the sermon for the grieving.","Are you carrying a grief you have not named? Name it tonight.","kh-yaqub")
B.bFd=new A.br("The First Sermon of the First Caliph","Abu Bakr\u2019s first words as caliph: I have been given authority over you, but I am not the best among you. Leadership begins with humility.","Where do you lead \u2014 and does your leadership begin with humility?","kh-abubakr")
B.bFW=new A.br("The Grammar of Loss","Inna lillahi wa inna ilayhi raji\u2019un \u2014 to Allah we belong and to Him we return. The sentence that turns a hit into an address.","What loss in your life needs the grammar of return tonight?","kh-innalillah")
B.bFh=new A.br("The Phone in the Hand","The sermon for the screen: the scroll that eats the hour, the feed that is not real. Your attention is an amanah too.","What did your phone eat today that you wish it had not?","kh-phone")
B.bGu=new A.br("Anxiety and the Medicine of Ta\u2019weel","Perhaps you dislike a thing and it is good for you (2:216). The re-framing that turns the 3am ceiling into a conversation.","What are you anxious about \u2014 and what could the ta\u2019weel be?","kh-anxiety")
B.bFj=new A.br("The Quiet Chain","Debt is a chain that gets heavier the longer it is ignored. The sermon for the debtor who is afraid to look at the number.","What number are you afraid to look at? Look at it tonight.","kh-debt")
B.bFm=new A.br("Loneliness in the Crowd","Five hundred friends and no one to call. The sermon for the connected and the isolated \u2014 and the three doors back.","Who could you call tonight that you have not spoken to in a month?","kh-lonely")
B.bFx=new A.br("Raising Children in the Feed","The parent\u2019s sermon: your child is growing up in a feed you did not grow up in. The rules are the same; the arena is new.","What rule from your childhood needs a new arena-appropriate version?","kh-raising")
B.bGw=new A.br("Built to Rest","The burnout sermon: the cure is not more productivity \u2014 it is barakah. The sabbath of the soul is prayer in the middle of the hustle.","When did you last rest without guilt? Schedule one this week.","kh-burnout")
B.bFN=new A.br("The News That Ate the Heart","The news cycle is designed to keep you angry and afraid. Guard your heart \u2014 and your duas \u2014 from the feed.","What news did you consume today that changed nothing you could act on?","kh-news")
B.bFX=new A.br("For the One Who Is Tired","The sermon for exhaustion: with hardship comes ease, in the same sentence twice. The tired one is not the failed one.","Are you tired \u2014 and have you told Allah, or only the ceiling?","kh-tired-013")
B.bGc=new A.br("The Load She Carries","The sermon for the woman who carries the house and the job and the faith: your load is seen, and it is not forever.","What load are you carrying that no one has named? Name it to someone this week.","kh-women-carry")
B.bFf=new A.br("The Door That Opens With the Pain","Sabr is not waiting for the storm to pass \u2014 it is learning to stand in the rain. The sermon for the season that has lasted too long.","What storm are you standing in \u2014 and are you standing or running?","kh-patience")
B.bGh=new A.br("The Increase Clause","If you are grateful, I will surely increase you (14:7). The contract with increase written into it.",u.lX,"kh-gratitude")
B.awH=s([B.bG1,B.bFa,B.bFS,B.bFd,B.bFW,B.bFh,B.bGu,B.bFj,B.bFm,B.bFx,B.bGw,B.bFN,B.bFX,B.bGc,B.bFf,B.bGh],t.jm)
B.bF1=new A.n5("The Khutbahs \u2014 Sermons for the Heavy Days","The Friday sermon, distilled into its theme \u2014 for the day you need that exact word.",B.awH)
