B.bEE=new A.eE("The Year of the Elephant","The hour of birth, and the army that could not enter Makkah.")
B.bEy=new A.eE("The Orphan of Makkah","Father gone before birth, mother at six, grandfather at eight \u2014 and yet al-Amin, the trustworthy.")
B.bEz=new A.eE("Al-Amin, The Trustworthy","The title Makkah gave him before revelation \u2014 character precedes the call.")
B.bEw=new A.eE("The Cave of Hira","Forty years old, seeking quiet \u2014 and the first word is Iqra.")
B.bEI=new A.eE("Iqra \u2014 The First Word","Read, in the name of your Lord. The first revelation chose knowledge.")
B.bEo=new A.eE("Three Years of Whispers","Secret teaching, then open call \u2014 patience measured in years.")
B.bEN=new A.eE("Bilal and the Heavy Sand","One word \u2014 Ahad \u2014 heavier than the mountain of sand on his chest.")
B.bEp=new A.eE("The Night of the Journey","From the Haram to Jerusalem to the seven heavens in one night.")
B.bEA=new A.eE("The Boycott","Three years of siege in the valley \u2014 and the believers stayed.")
B.bEm=new A.eE("The First Hijrah","To Abyssinia, where a just king protected the weak \u2014 Musab carried the message.")
B.bEq=new A.eE("The Conversion of Umar","The man who came to kill left proclaiming \u2014 strength that found its direction.")
B.bEs=new A.eE("Taif","Driven to a vineyard outside the city, he prayed to Allah in his weakness and hoped for their descendants.")
B.bEJ=new A.eE("The Pledges of Aqabah","The people of Yathrib reach for the Prophet \u2014 a city will be renamed after him.")
