B.aYK=new A.bz("prophets","Stories of the Prophets","Peace be upon them all")
B.aZ2=new A.bz("women","Women of Islam","The hearts that carried the light")
B.aYv=new A.bz("seerah","The Seerah","The life of the Prophet \u0635\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0648\u0633\u0644\u0645")
B.aYH=new A.bz("companions","The Companions","The generation that held the light")
B.aYy=new A.bz("ghayb","Al-Ghayb \u2014 The Unseen","Angels, jinn, the Last Day, and the 2am questions")
B.aZg=new A.bz("signs","Signs & the Last Day","What is coming, with certainty")
B.aYk=new A.bz("tales","Tales of the Ummah","Stories of the generations between")
B.aZ6=new A.bz("khutbahs","Khutbahs","Sermons for the classics and for today")
B.aYG=new A.bz("modernhadith","Hadiths for Our Times","The pressures of this age, answered")
B.aZ1=new A.bz("dailyduas","Daily Duas","For waking, eating, travel, hardship, and home")
B.aYm=new A.bz("newmuslim","The New Muslim Path","Thirty gentle days, one step at a time")
B.aHu=s([B.aYK,B.aZ2,B.aYv,B.aYH,B.aYy,B.aZg,B.aYk,B.aZ6,B.aYG,B.aZ1,B.aYm],t.iT)
B.bst=new A.o7("Eat of the Good Things","O people, eat from the earth what is lawful and good, and do not follow the footsteps of Shaytan (2:168). The halal plate is not a restriction list \u2014 it is an invitation to eat well, eat clean, and eat with gratitude.",u.oY)
B.bso=new A.o7("The Third of the Stomach","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the son of Adam does not fill any vessel worse than his stomach \u2014 a few morsels for his back to stand straight; if he must fill it, then a third for food, a third for drink, a third for breath (Tirmidhi 2380, sahih per Darussalam). The oldest diet advice in history, from the one who knew the body\u2019s design.",u.F)
B.bsr=new A.o7("Sleep Is Worship\u2019s Fuel","The Prophet \ufdfa said: when one of you goes to bed, let him brush his hand over his bed \u2014 for he does not know what came upon it after him \u2014 then say: in Your name, my Lord, I lay down my side (Bukhari 6320). Sleep entered the sunna; the night is not a waste, it is the deposit of the morning\u2019s prayer.",u.s)
B.bss=new A.o7("Moderation in All Things","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the religion is ease (Bukhari 39). And he fasted but did not fast continuously; he prayed but he slept; he worked but he rested. Extremism in worship is not devotion \u2014 it is a debt the body will collect.",u.kF)
B.aFt=s([B.bst,B.bso,B.bsr,B.bss],t.Qt)
B.bsw=new A.Kp("The Body as an Amanah","Your body is a trust \u2014 you did not build it, you were lent it. The Prophet \ufdfa said: your body has a right over you (Bukhari 1975).",B.aFt)
B.bsv=new A.o7("The Prophet\u2019s Own Ruqyah","The Prophet \ufdfa taught someone in pain to place a hand on the spot that hurts, say bismillah three times, then say seven times: I seek refuge in Allah\u2019s might and power from the evil of what I feel and fear (Muslim 2202). The cure begins with refuge, not with the symptom.",u.e_)
B.bsp=new A.o7("The Evil Eye Is Real \u2014 and Curable","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the evil eye is real, and if anything were to overtake the divine decree, it would be the evil eye (Muslim 2188). And he taught the cure: the mu\u2019awwidhat (the last three surahs) recited over the afflicted. The protection is not paranoia; it is a sunna carried lightly.","When you admire something \u2014 your child, your home, your health \u2014 say mashallah, la quwwata illa billah. Guard the blessing by naming its Owner.")
B.bsn=new A.o7("When Medicine and Faith Meet","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah did not send down a disease without sending down its cure (Bukhari 5678). Use the medicine \u2014 the ruqyah does not cancel the doctor; the doctor does not cancel the ruqyah. Seeking treatment is not weak faith; it is the sunna.",u.iW)
B.aLS=s([B.bsv,B.bsp,B.bsn],t.Qt)
B.bsy=new A.Kp("Ruqyah \u2014 the Qur\u2019an as Medicine","And We send down of the Qur\u2019an that which is healing and mercy for the believers (17:82). The verses are medicine; the reciter is the patient.",B.aLS)
B.bsu=new A.o7("The Day of the Heart\u2019s Surgery","The day when neither wealth nor children will avail, except one who comes to Allah with a sound heart (26:88-89). Every practice in this school \u2014 food, sleep, ruqyah, moderation \u2014 is finally aimed here. The sound heart is the only luggage that boards.",u.ek)
B.bsq=new A.o7("Dhikr Is the Heart\u2019s Food","Those who remember Allah standing, sitting, and on their sides (3:191). The heart without dhikr is the body without food \u2014 it does not die loudly; it just grows numb. The morning and evening adhkar are the three meals of the soul.",u.jX)
B.aCq=s([B.bsu,B.bsq],t.Qt)
B.bsx=new A.Kp("The Heart\u2019s Health","The body\u2019s final organ is the heart \u2014 and it has diseases with cures the Qur\u2019an names.",B.aCq)
B.aHv=s([B.bsw,B.bsy,B.bsx],A.ab("z<Kp>"))
